<title>MONACO: RALLYING-MONTE CARLO LEADING PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-MONTE CARLO LEADING PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>MONTE CARLO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading overall placings in</p>
<p>the Monte Carlo world championship rally after 13 timed stages</p>
<p>on Wednesday:</p>
<p> 1. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza  three hours 35 minutes</p>
<p>25 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford Escort	     3:35:37</p>
<p> 3. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer  3:35:39</p>
<p> 4. Armin Schwarz (Germany) Ford Escort	  3:39:18</p>
<p> 5. Uwe Nittel (Germany) Mitsubishi Lancer     3:44:28</p>
<p> 6. Dieter Depping (Germany) Ford Escort	 3:46:54</p>
<p> 7. Henrik Lundgaard (Denmark) Toyota Celica   3:51:37</p>
<p> 8. Olivier Burri (Switzerland) Subaru Impreza 3:51:42</p>
<p> 9. Gustavo Trelles (Spain) Mitsubishi Lancer  3:54:37</p>
<p> 10. Isolde Holderied (Germany) Toyota Celica  3:55:42</p>
